close_reason: "Repaired the stranded mid-edit state (three TS2304 stderr errors in the gate test), raised the gate from 90/70/75 to a measured 100/100/100, and brought scripts/coverage-gate.ts under coverageGate.sources with an empty ignore list. The gate now measures itself: runScriptEntry is exported and guarded on process.argv[1], so the entry branch is exercised in-process by tests with a mocked process.exit rather than escaping measurement in a separate wrapper file."
